@startuml
left to right direction
actor Visitor
actor Customer
actor Specialist
actor Administrator
rectangle "Car Repair Platform website" as Website
Visitor --> Website : search, registration, sign-in
Website --> Visitor : profiles, reviews, account result
Customer --> Website : request, confirmation, review, complaint
Website --> Customer : status, history, feedback
Specialist --> Website : profile and status updates
Website --> Specialist : assigned requests and history
Administrator --> Website : moderation decisions
Website --> Administrator : complaints and records
note bottom of Website
Telephone arrangements are outside system scope.
No external payment or messaging integration is selected.
end note
@enduml
